  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.PostgreSql.AdoNet 0.1.0-alpha.2\n\n      Added\n      - PostgreSQL ADO.NET outbox writer using application-owned transactions.\n      - PostgreSQL worker store with atomic lease-based claiming.\n      - PostgreSQL schema helper and packed schema script.\n      - Dependency injection registration for PostgreSQL ADO.NET publishing and worker processing.\n      - PostgreSQL runtime tests and sample application.\n\n      Notes\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - Consumers must be idempotent because delivery is at-least-once.",
